window.LESSONS["3C"].grammar = {points:[{"label": "استراتژی ۱", "title": "Short supportive responses with really and sure", "html": "<h3>قاعده</h3>\n<p>برای نشان دادن حمایت و همراهی در مکالمه، از پاسخ‌های کوتاه با <b>really</b> یا <b>sure</b> استفاده می‌کنیم.</p>\n<div class=\"ex\">\"This is the most incredible place!\" → \"Yeah, it <span class=\"hl\">really</span> is.\"</div>\n<div class=\"ex\">\"It feels good to be out of the city.\" → \"It <span class=\"hl\">sure</span> does.\"</div>\n<div class=\"note\">فعل کمکی جمله را تکرار می‌کنیم (is→is, does→does) و really/sure را قبل یا بعد از آن می‌آوریم.</div>"},{"label": "استراتژی ۲", "title": "Using superlatives for emphasis", "html": "<h3>قاعده</h3>\n<p>از صفت عالی (superlative) برای تأکید بر احساس یا نظرتان استفاده می‌کنید، نه فقط برای مقایسه‌ی واقعی.</p>\n<div class=\"ex\">\"This is the <span class=\"hl\">most incredible</span> place!\"</div>\n<div class=\"ex\">\"I had the <span class=\"hl\">best</span> time.\"</div>"}],bookExC4:[{"q": "The weather was great last Saturday. → What's the best response?", "o": ["It really was. I spent the whole day outdoors.", "You're right. We really should.", "Yeah, you sure can.", "No, it really doesn't. That's too bad."], "a": 0, "ex": ""}, {"q": "This city doesn't have many parks. → What's the best response?", "o": ["No, it really doesn't. That's too bad.", "It really was. I spent the whole day outdoors.", "Yeah. It sure is.", "Yeah, you sure can."], "a": 0, "ex": ""}, {"q": "We should go hiking sometime. → What's the best response?", "o": ["You're right. We really should.", "It really was. I spent the whole day outdoors.", "Yeah, you sure can.", "Yeah. It sure is."], "a": 0, "ex": ""}, {"q": "The lake here is a great place to go swimming. → What's the best response?", "o": ["Yeah, you sure can.", "No, it really doesn't. That's too bad.", "You're right. We really should.", "It really was. I spent the whole day outdoors."], "a": 0, "ex": ""}, {"q": "I like being out of the city. You can hear the birds. → What's the best response?", "o": ["Yeah. It sure is.", "No, it really doesn't. That's too bad.", "You're right. We really should.", "Yeah, you sure can."], "a": 0, "ex": ""}],bookExC6:[{"q": "Where's your favorite place to hang out? — I like going to cafés. You see _____ people. (interesting)", "o": ["the most interesting", "interestinger"], "a": 0, "ex": ""}, {"q": "Where's a good place to get out of the city? — The mountains. It's so quiet, and you can see _____ wildlife. (amazing)", "o": ["the most amazing", "amazingest"], "a": 0, "ex": ""}, {"q": "I heard you can take a boat trip down the river. — You sure can. You can get _____ views of the city. (good)", "o": ["the best", "the goodest"], "a": 0, "ex": ""}, {"q": "How was your vacation? — We went sailing around some islands. I had _____ time. (good)", "o": ["the best", "the goodest"], "a": 0, "ex": ""}]};
